  "draft_py": "# Claws Out (FDN).\n# \"Affinity for Cats (This spell costs {1} less to cast for each Cat you control.)\" -- CR 702.41a:\n#   the reminder is the rule. ZNR Coveted Prize's B8-party-discount CostModifier (IS_SOURCE, YOU,\n#   reduce generic QBin(MUL, 1, count)), the count M21 Sanctum of Tranquil Light's \"for each Shrine\n#   you control\" QCount, over Cats (a creature type: SUBTYPE_EQ Cat + TYPE_EQ Creature).\n# \"Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.\" -- compiled (B4-modify-pt-eot-you), kept.\nabilities = [\n    CostModifier(\n        filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n        controller_ref=ControllerRef.YOU,\n        delta=CostDeltaReduceGeneric(\n            amount=QBin(\n                op=QBinOp.MUL,\n                left=QConst(value=1),\n                right=QCount(\n                    selector=Selector(\n                        count=QUnbounded(),\n                        mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n                        filter=FAnd(\n                            children=(\n                                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n                                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.SUBTYPE_EQ, string_value='Cat'),\n                                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                            ),\n                        ),\n                        zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                    ),\n                ),\n            ),\n        ),\n    ),\n    compiled[0],\n]\n",
